COLOR / SI / A11Y NOTES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
colors : EV/electric -> TeslaTokens.status.info (#00f0ff dark), gas/ICE -> status.danger (#ef4444),
         savings -> status.success (#10b981) — the design-token analogues of the web neon hexes (ADR-005); the
         single "Cost/km" bar series uses ChartPalette.categorical[0] (paletteColor(0)) and the cyan/red split is
         carried by the two pill cards, mirroring the web single `<Bar name="Cost/km">` + colored summary cards.
si     : SI read off the wire; converted ONLY at the display boundary — energy via formatEnergy(total_wh, UnitPref)
         (web useUnits().formatEnergy), distance via convertDistanceFromSI(total_km*1000, unit) (web), currency via
         the user's settings symbol/precision/locale (web useFormatting). No miles/mph/kWh stored or computed; the
         backend-derived per-km rates rendered verbatim (web parity).
a11y   : panel/hero icons decorative (contentDescription=null); each chart carries accessibleDescription = its web
         aria string (chart-a11y:no-table parity — no data table, value announced by the description); the CostPill
         carries a "<label> <value>" contentDescription; all color via MaterialTheme.colorScheme + TeslaTokens.status
         (A2 tokens) => dynamic color + dark theme; typography via the role components (no raw text styles). Compose-
         native only (no webview).

